    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817560/extras/d80a0d2fe3fbd00f46937166f2e51da7.avif?t=1755249419\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817560/extras/9b1f2fd27ded782e50ca4d92ab89749e.poster.avif?t=1755249419\" width=676 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817560/extras/9b1f2fd27ded782e50ca4d92ab89749e.webm?t=1755249419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817560/extras/9b1f2fd27ded782e50ca4d92ab89749e.mp4?t=1755249419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>A fast-paced Sci-Fi arcade racer inspired by the adrenaline-fueled videogame and cartoon classics of the 2000s.<br>This is more than a race\u2014it's a test of friendship, courage, and duty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817560/extras/d1600ed72f1d16c6156c9e234555732a.webp?t=1755249419\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a future where distant worlds are connected by mysterious <i>Paths</i> and nine nations wage an implacable war against each other, the appearance of a divine being \u2013 the <i>Great Serpent</i> \u2013 \u200b\u200bchanges everything. He announces the beginning of a great trial:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Race of the Nine Worlds</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nine champions. One winner.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The prize? Control over the <i>Paths</i> and the power to change the fate of the universe.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817560/extras/6095887582564cf301c225e551f11d21.avif?t=1755249419\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter <i>Balt</i>, a daring young fox from the Rinki tribe, whose childhood dreams of racing among the stars are suddenly within reach. With powerful rivals, dangerous tracks, and mysterious forces at play, <i>Balt</i> must navigate more than just sharp turns if he hopes to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817560/extras/ccbbdba1e90c79396f3870a8088cc6fe.webp?t=1755249419\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock all nine champions, each with a distinct vehicle, playstyle, and game-changing Ultimate Ability. Master them to dominate the track.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817560/extras/468cb798b9536637d88505652c290d93.avif?t=1755249419\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Serpent Seals to activate unpredictable track events. Play smart\u2014or suffer the consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817560/extras/c338c44aab2df19f18eb96f16217237f.webp?t=1755249419\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your champions in races against other players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The <i>Great Serpent</i> has called. The Race has begun.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you rise to become the champion who changes everything?</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817560/extras/d80a0d2fe3fbd00f46937166f2e51da7.avif?t=1755249419\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817560/extras/9b1f2fd27ded782e50ca4d92ab89749e.poster.avif?t=1755249419\" width=676 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817560/extras/9b1f2fd27ded782e50ca4d92ab89749e.webm?t=1755249419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817560/extras/9b1f2fd27ded782e50ca4d92ab89749e.mp4?t=1755249419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>A fast-paced Sci-Fi arcade racer inspired by the adrenaline-fueled videogame and cartoon classics of the 2000s.<br>This is more than a race\u2014it's a test of friendship, courage, and duty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817560/extras/d1600ed72f1d16c6156c9e234555732a.webp?t=1755249419\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a future where distant worlds are connected by mysterious <i>Paths</i> and nine nations wage an implacable war against each other, the appearance of a divine being \u2013 the <i>Great Serpent</i> \u2013 \u200b\u200bchanges everything. He announces the beginning of a great trial:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Race of the Nine Worlds</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nine champions. One winner.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The prize? Control over the <i>Paths</i> and the power to change the fate of the universe.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817560/extras/6095887582564cf301c225e551f11d21.avif?t=1755249419\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter <i>Balt</i>, a daring young fox from the Rinki tribe, whose childhood dreams of racing among the stars are suddenly within reach. With powerful rivals, dangerous tracks, and mysterious forces at play, <i>Balt</i> must navigate more than just sharp turns if he hopes to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817560/extras/ccbbdba1e90c79396f3870a8088cc6fe.webp?t=1755249419\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock all nine champions, each with a distinct vehicle, playstyle, and game-changing Ultimate Ability. Master them to dominate the track.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817560/extras/468cb798b9536637d88505652c290d93.avif?t=1755249419\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Serpent Seals to activate unpredictable track events. Play smart\u2014or suffer the consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817560/extras/c338c44aab2df19f18eb96f16217237f.webp?t=1755249419\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your champions in races against other players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The <i>Great Serpent</i> has called. The Race has begun.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you rise to become the champion who changes everything?</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Take part in the Race of Nine Worlds! Play as one of the nine Path Racers, rush through the tracks of fantastic planets, go through an exciting story campaign and become a legend who will restore peace among the warring galaxies.",
